      "text": "and returns the closest matches. Grounded prompting reduces hallucination. A good RAG prompt tells the model to answer only from the retrieved context and to say it does not know when the answer is missing. Metadata is important in RAG systems. Each chunk should remember its source file, page number when available, and chunk number. This allows the final answer to include citations and helps users verify the response.",
